WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Stand with back, head, and sacrum lightly on a wall.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Arms in a goalpost shape, elbows and wrists near the wall.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Slide arms up and down slowly without arching.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Keep ribs soft.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Finish with a tall easy stand.
